i-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a7e1b630ead60caa\" href=\"?note=a7e1b630ead60caa\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md\">../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec U\\in V\">\\(\\vec U\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\sigma]\\coloneqq\\{x\\in2^\\omega:\\sigma\\subseteq x\\}\">\\([\\sigma]\\coloneqq\\{x\\in2^\\omega:\\sigma\\subseteq x\\}\\)</span> for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_C\\coloneqq\\sigma_{2^\\omega}(\\{[\\sigma]:\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\})\">\\(\\Sigma_C\\coloneqq\\sigma_{2^\\omega}(\\{[\\sigma]:\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\})\\)</span> (Cantor 空间柱集生成的 sigma-代数, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e03c77e7d23896d9\" href=\"?note=e03c77e7d23896d9\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-sigma-generated.md\">../batch08/58-df-sigma-generated.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner n,\\sigma\\urcorner\\coloneqq\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}(n,\\operatorname{SeqCode}_{58}(\\sigma))\">\\(\\ulcorner n,\\sigma\\urcorner\\coloneqq\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}(n,\\operatorname{SeqCode}_{58}(\\sigma))\\)</span>；两个编码函数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a7e1b630ead60caa\" href=\"?note=a7e1b630ead60caa\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md\">../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputablyEnumerableSet}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputablyEnumerableSet}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (c.e. 自然数集谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"7b1ff54ac76ee59d\" href=\"?note=7b1ff54ac76ee59d\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-zfc-comp-computably-enumerable-set.md\">../batch20/58-df-zfc-comp-computably-enumerable-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (概率空间谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4MartinLofTest}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4MartinLofTest}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}martin\\text{-}lof\\text{-}test}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4MartinLofTest}_S(\\vec U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\vec U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^\\omega\n\\land\\exists W\\subseteq\\omega\\times2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\exists\\lambda\\in V\\;\n\\left(\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputablyEnumerableSet}_S\\bigl(\\{\\ulcorner n,\\sigma\\urcorner:\\langle n,\\sigma\\rangle\\in W\\}\\bigr)\n\\land\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(2^\\omega,\\Sigma_C,\\lambda)\n\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(\\lambda([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|})\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\left(\\vec U(n)=\\bigcup\\{[\\sigma]:\\langle n,\\sigma\\rangle\\in W\\}\n\\land \\vec U(n)\\in\\Sigma_C\n\\land\\lambda(\\vec U(n))\\leq2^{-n}\\right)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}martin\\text{-}lof\\text{-}test}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4MartinLofTest}_S(\\vec U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\vec U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^\\omega\n\\land\\exists W\\subseteq\\omega\\times2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\exists\\lambda\\in V\\;\n\\left(\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputablyEnumerableSet}_S\\bigl(\\{\\ulcorner n,\\sigma\\urcorner:\\langle n,\\sigma\\rangle\\in W\\}\\bigr)\n\\land\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(2^\\omega,\\Sigma_C,\\lambda)\n\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(\\lambda([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|})\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\left(\\vec U(n)=\\bigcup\\{[\\sigma]:\\langle n,\\sigma\\rangle\\in W\\}\n\\land \\vec U(n)\\in\\Sigma_C\n\\land\\lambda(\\vec U(n))\\leq2^{-n}\\right)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The test is a genuine sequence of subsets of Cantor space; requiring only\na relation with domain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> did not make the notation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec U(n)\">\\(\\vec U(n)\\)</span> functional.</li>\n<li>Uniform c.e. openness is imposed on one coded set of pairs, while the fair-coin measure is characterized by its values <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{-|\\sigma|}\">\\(2^{-|\\sigma|}\\)</span> on all basic cylinders.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-zfc-comp-computably-enumerable-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"7b1ff54ac76ee59d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-comp-computably-enumerable-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-sigma-generated.md","status":"resolved","id":"e03c77e7d23896d9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batc